olor:#121212;">
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">If I=E2=80=99d been asked before the USAid=
 shutdown if I was an advocate of international aid, I=E2=80=99d have had a=
 long, heavily caveated response that landed somewhere close to no. Do weal=
thy nations have a moral (and reparative) duty to aid poorer ones? Absolute=
ly. Development and investment collaborations? Necessary. Supporting govern=
ments and businesses to build healthcare and education systems and end conf=
lict? Totally. A natural disaster? The world and their dog should be pourin=
g in to help.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">But, the aid system as it was? Flawed, ful=
l of north to south diktats, and too often entrenching not only dependency =
but also a skewed geographical narrative.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">These shortcomings perversely enhanced aid=
=E2=80=99s soft power effect and supported an industry that needed reform.<=
/p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">The speed at which the aid cuts came =E2=
=80=93 the loss of data and research, the axing of lifelines, the closed cl=
inics and empty pharmacy shelves =E2=80=93 was awful. Thousands have and wi=
ll die thanks to the crude destabilising by the Trump administration, along=
side the longer term slashing of aid budgets by governments from the UK to =
Sweden to Germany.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">As the international aid system is being r=
eplaced by a new type of hard power by the Trump administration, bullying A=
frican nations out of their resources, while a new sidelining of developing=
 countries is apparent from most European politicians convinced voters don=
=E2=80=99t care, suddenly the old system looks better than nothing.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">Maybe proper partnerships will develop fro=
m the ashes. My colleague Kenneth Mohammed <a href=3D"https://ablink.editor=
ial.theguardian.com/ss/c/u001.Yw_JkLMEmFuifc_XG18IRyTNtZQ7fIEMgszcCSneHECVi=
DoBXM111GPfwXhNil2DvvbRaVHwS5Nh8EsHH1VYyk-twLNHckNdryzoC5PxnBRmohZgoJdHqi_q=
K613ZX9FxbtPNi5i_WX_UF7U2B2FwXh0vhqYvD4KpW4jWjA-ONyu6CbX6ENC6VPQOgfGZePI_of=
5wdJIB4o3MWONJDssE-UCyZ2rRJkYX89PlGcHdA-q4XXQIjEytyd_mJ363ohQLuBXPE4DoCQz7e=
