losing their livelihood. Suraj Kumar=E2=80=99s job was to feed discarded cl=
othes into shredding machines but three months into the job an electrical s=
hort circuit propelled him into the mechanism. =E2=80=9CI wish I had died r=
ather than lost both my arms,=E2=80=9D he says. His story is <a href=3D"htt=
ps://ablink.editorial.theguardian.com/ss/c/u001.Yw_JkLMEmFuifc_XG18IRyTNtZQ=
